# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: PayPal
# Description: Official PayPal payment, gateway, and corporate operational services
# Methodology: Curated from blackmatrix7 PayPal.list (248 entries), isolating
# verifiable production infrastructure and filtering out 230+ fraudulent,
# typo-squatting, phishing, and unrelated legacy domains.
# ==============================================================================

# --- Core Consumer, Merchant & CDN Infrastructure (SEC Form 10-K) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypalobjects.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal-corp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypalcorp.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal-mktg.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paypal-prepaid.com

# --- Official Subsidiaries & Payment Processing Platforms ---
# Braintree (Merchant Gateway & Payments, acquired by PayPal 2013)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,braintreegateway.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,braintreepayments.com
# Venmo (P2P Mobile Payments, PayPal subsidiary)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,venmo.com
# Xoom (Cross-Border Remittance, acquired by PayPal 2015)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,xoom.com
# Simility (Risk Management & Fraud Prevention, acquired by PayPal 2018)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,simility.com
# Paydiant (Mobile Wallet Technology, acquired by PayPal 2015)
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,paydiant.com

# --- PayPal China Operating Entities (Guopay / 贝宝 / 安付通) ---
# Verified via National Enterprise Credit Information & MIIT ICP filing
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anfutong.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anfutong.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,anfutong.com.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,beibao.cn
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,beibao.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,beibao.com.cn
